  "description": "The story follows the everyday life of Itsuki, a novelist and \"modern day Pygmalion\" who works day in and day out to create the ultimate younger sister. He's surrounded by various other characters: a beautiful genius writer who loves him, his big-sisterly classmate from college, a fellow male writer, a sadistic tax accountant, and his editor. They're all looked after by Itsuki's perfect younger step-brother, Chihiro, who has a serious secret.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)<br>\n<br>\n<i>Note: The first episode received an early screening at a special event held at Shinjuku Piccadilly, Tokyo on 06.09.2017.</i>",
